{"data":{"title":"What a Life","slug":"what-a-life","path":"/artists/dirg-gerner/tracks/what-a-life/","artwork":"images/artists/dirg-gerner/tracks/what-a-life.jpg","artist":{"id":"3FTasZdjce0","slug":"dirg-gerner","links":null,"title":"Dirg Gerner","artwork":null},"id":"jUXeXqSTYXA"},"appearanceCount":1,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"qoj5IS3WuCk","show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":48318,"platform":"spotify","href":"https://open.spotify.com/track/2HVNY9dt8UQApFSH3jzIFV","artwork":"https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b27375e0e9b6c09778db9cd2489e","last_checked_at":"2020-12-15T17:59:25.182+00:00","track":"jUXeXqSTYXA"},{"id":48320,"platform":"deezer","href":"https://www.deezer.com/track/1006206482","artwork":"https://e-cdns-images.dzcdn.net/images/cover/444b7645361a3a3deab5097373e47be2/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-12-15T17:59:22.774+00:00","track":"jUXeXqSTYXA"},{"id":48312,"platform":"googlePlayMusic","href":"https://play.google.com/store/music/album?id=Blmi67hr5rla3vgkvbuf2kv52sq&tid=song-Ty2oqkwrrsfnsw6mebcpljbmkky","artwork":"https://lh3.googleuserc